MoonwellPulseOpen
MoonwellPulse
JournalAction
JournalResource
JournalPayload
JournalResult

capability world-journal-capability

moonwell-pulse:
  ?pulse shape MoonwellPulse
  ?action shape JournalAction
  ?resource shape JournalResource
  ?payload shape JournalPayload
  ?result shape JournalResult
  ?pulse:
    records ?action at ?resource with ?payload yielding: ?result

mode moonwell-pulse given pulse action resource payload yields result: many
  reactive while MoonwellPulseOpen
  continues linearly
  effect action resource resource payload payload requires world-journal-capability
